Z||000002||Greg Piet||04-09-2001||09:43 AM||||I saw the commercial asking if one knew about the email movie, then there was some guy out on the range, then the announcer was saying the guy on the range hasnt seen that movie... I got a kick out of it.  If that is the commercial your referring to, I do not think  FORD was questioning anyones masculinity.<P>To be blunt the average american cannot even change their own tire anymore.  So even if FORD was questioning ones masculinity I ask you if you can change your tire.  If so, no worries, and the reason being...<P>I have gotten calls from my friends asking me how to change their tire... I had to tell one guy that his spare was under the bed of his toyota pickup, then proceded to tell him how to lower the tire down.  I have never even seen a spare on a Toyota pickup, so I went my expereince with a Datsun truck I used to own (ahh I miss that little truck), and in every full size truck I have dealt with the spare was lying in the bed.<P>Loafer I know that episode... that one is really frickin funny!<p>[This message has been edited by Greg Piet (edited 04-09-2001).]||||reg||1
